---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { business } from "../config";
---

<Layout
  title="Website privacy"
  description="How website enquiries and email correspondence are handled by Moxin Sterling Advisory. Separate information is available for the My Money app."
>
  <section class="page-hero container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Website information</p>
    <h1>Website privacy.</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      This page describes the website’s email-draft enquiry mode. It does not
      cover the My Money app.
    </p>
  </section>
  <article class="section container prose">
    <p>Last updated: 28 October 2026.</p>
    <h2>Who to contact</h2>
    <p>
      For questions about website enquiries, contact {business.name} at{" "}
      <a href={`mailto:${business.email}`}>{business.email}</a>.
    </p>
    <h2>The enquiry form</h2>
    <p>
      In the current email-draft mode, the website does not send form entries to
      a form service or store them in a website database. The form prepares a
      draft in your email app containing your name, email address, optional
      business name, business type, service of interest and message. You decide
      whether to send it.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you send that email, your email provider and the recipient’s email
      provider process it. The recipient address is a Yahoo email address. Your
      message is used to read and respond to your enquiry and discuss any
      services you request. Please send only the information needed for that
      conversation.
    </p>
    <h2>Visiting the website</h2>
    <p>
      The website does not include analytics, advertising trackers, embedded
      maps or chat widgets. It does not set application cookies or use browser
      storage. The static hosting provider may process connection information
      such as IP addresses and request logs when delivering pages. The host and
      its privacy information must be identified before public launch.
    </p>
    <h2>Enquiries and your choices</h2>
    <p>
      Please do not include tax identifiers, bank details, passwords or identity
      documents in an initial enquiry. Contact us if you want to ask about
      access to, correction of or deletion of correspondence. Rights and any
      applicable exceptions depend on the relevant data protection law. You may
      also contact the UK Information Commissioner’s Office at{" "}
      <a href="https://ico.org.uk/">ico.org.uk</a>.
    </p>
    <h2>Before using professional services</h2>
    <p>
      An enquiry does not create an accountant-client relationship. Data
      handling for an engagement will need to be explained separately with the
      agreed work.
    </p>
    <h2>Publication status</h2>
    <p>
      The controller’s legal details, the lawful basis for handling enquiries,
      the retention period, hosting provider and any international transfer
      arrangements are awaiting confirmation. This page must be reviewed with
      those details before public launch. If a submission provider is enabled,
      this notice must be updated before it receives enquiries.
    </p>
    <h2>My Money app</h2>
    <p>
      The app has separate data handling information. See{" "}
      <a href="/my-money-privacy/">My Money app privacy</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
